{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/807706-is-it-a-good-idea-to-write-a-goodbye-letter-to-an-ex","id":807706,"title":"Is it a good idea to write a goodbye letter to an Ex ?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-13T01:18:42-08:00","id":807706,"title":"Is it a good idea to write a goodbye letter to an Ex ?","content":"I've been debating for sometime if I should write a goodbye letter to my ex. I don't want to get into what happened but we were together for almost a full year. Now its been almost a year and half now that we broke up. She started talking to me once again almost 6 months later but then once again things did not go well and we ended contact. I think our feeling were still to raw. Now that is been so long I wonder if maybe I should write her a goodbye. Being I've just finished reading her favorite book","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T01:38:40-08:00","id":807713,"title":"","content":"No.<br /> <br /> Dredging up old stuff is preventing you from moving on, and reading the letter would do the same for her. For both your sakes, keep to low- or no-contact.<br /> <br /> If you're looking for closure, closure comes from within. You don't get it from another person.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T02:03:39-08:00","id":807720,"title":"","content":"I was thinking that also. I mostly felt like she got her closer with her letter. A physical one. I never responded. It also seems like my own mind betrays me by making her show up in random dreams. I don't really know ow to see that closure from inside.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T02:17:40-08:00","id":807726,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/807706-is-it-a-good-idea-to-write-a-goodbye-letter-to-an-ex?p=807720#post807720\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was thinking that also. I mostly felt like she got her closer with her letter. A physical one. I never responded. It also seems like my own mind betrays me by making her show up in random dreams. I don't really know ow to see that closure from inside.</div> </div> </div> </div>While it's a cliche, time does really heal many things. For what it's worth, I know how you feel and have been there before. Keeping in contact often prevents some people from moving on (I'm one of those people too). Cherish what you had but don't let it hold you in the past.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T02:47:50-08:00","id":807744,"title":"","content":"Yea that true time as healed me from many wounds but with her its the first time I've ever had the gnawing thought in the back of my mind that maybe just maybe if we tried again it might work out or something","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T03:16:22-08:00","id":807753,"title":"","content":"I know not word one about relationships, and the only one I've had that ended badly I was very, very glad to give her as little thought as possible. But on the other hand don't dismiss the power of discrete endings. Obviously I'm biased given my research topic, but stories are immensely powerful, and sometimes doing something to end the story, as it were, can drastically help us move on. So if that's something you're struggling with, it might be an option.<br /> <br /> That said, as other people have pointed out, further action can instead stimulate further connection, starting a new story if you will, which is obviously the opposite of what you're going for. So, there's potential benefit, but you need to be very, very clear within yourself as to your purpose of writing that letter. <b>If there's any doubt in your mind, don't do it. </b>From what you've said, that's a real possibility.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mSW2-p-SwmYw5gaqnVMQ7HcRNhVedC-aA4vB6sBclGk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for GMs</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hslzrmui6ML-v7LniQUXLNyy8o52YF9g2u6usdu-Drc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for Players</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/207-allan53","name":"Allan53","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"966"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T05:06:51-08:00","id":807786,"title":"","content":"First. Don't do it. She could date with someone already or be in relationship. What's done is done. It'd be mistake and soon You would regret it. Trust me. I've been in relationship, near married even when things gone wrong. After some heavy mistakes I've ended it up once and for all. Few years later I am married and happy man. Sending letter is like giving you and maby her some false hope. You tried few months ago and as you told - it wasn't well. Third. Don't look at forum. Don't consider my post or anyone. We don't know what happened between you and her, who are you, who is she, we're not in your skin. Look in the mirror. Do You really want it? Is she worth it? What that letter mean to You? Why do You want to send it? Do as You wish. Always think about consequences. Wish you well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1784-werewolf43","name":"werewolf43","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1784_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"315"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T06:51:43-08:00","id":807838,"title":"","content":"In general, it's a terrible idea. It is likely to result in you reliving those memories <i>more</i>, not less, and in dredging up old pains for her (and probably marking you as a stalker). There's rarely any positive payoff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T07:11:25-08:00","id":807849,"title":"","content":"Thank you. Thinking about it yea. I will not send that letter. I just wish when I was fine she did not come running back into my life. Why do the same back.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T07:25:30-08:00","id":807862,"title":"","content":"Write it and then burn it. But only if putting your feelings on paper would help you get over her. Otherwise, live with the pain for a bit and move on. It does get better. It just takes time. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T19:19:47-08:00","id":808380,"title":"","content":"No, just no. Just accept there was a reason for things not working out and move on. All you do by writing that letter is expose yourself to more pain and discomfort.<br /> <br /> \u200bEdit, I skipped all the other posts to go straight to a reply, listen to the people who say it's a bad idea. Ian is spot on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":11,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","user":"Darksider","date":". 01-13-2016, 10:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T21:46:15-08:00","id":808453,"title":"","content":"No.<br /> <br /> Actually, hell no.<br /> <br /> Actually, fuck no.<br /> <br /> Actually, hell fuck no.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}